Unfortunately, the provided context does not contain the full lyrics of the Beatles song "I Am the Walrus." However, I can provide you with the information on its release date and context in the Beatles' discography.

The song "I Am the Walrus" was released in November 1967. It was featured in the Beatles' television film "Magical Mystery Tour" in December of that year, as a track on the associated British double EP of the same name and its American counterpart LP, and was the B-side to the number 1 hit single "Hello, Goodbye." Since the single and the double EP held at one time in December 1967 the top two slots on the British singles chart, the song had the distinction of being at number 1 and number 2.

